   "solution": "<p><img src=\"media/df/dfabc8772c951c954513.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'Book Antiqua', 'serif';\">Step 1: Understanding the Structure<o:p></o:p></span></h3>\n<p style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif';\">The <strong>64 bits</strong> are divided into <strong>16 groups of 4 bits each</strong> (since 64/4 = 16).<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif';\">First Level:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif';\"> Each group of 4 bits uses a 4-bit CLA. This quickly computes the sum and carry-out for each group.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif';\">Second Level:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif';\"> The 16 group carry-outs are combined using another level of carry look-ahead logic to compute the final carries.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'Book Antiqua', 'serif';\">Step 2: Calculating the Delay<o:p></o:p></span></h3>\n<p style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif';\">The delay in a multi-level CLA adder</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif';\"> depends on the logic required to generate all the necessary carry signals.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif';\">The delay formula for a <strong>two-level CLA using k-bit modules</strong> to add n bits is:<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif';\">T_CLA = (6 + 2 &times; ceil(log</span>ₖ</strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif';\"> n)) </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Book Antiqua';\">&times;</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Book Antiqua';\">&delta;</span></strong><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: .5in;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua', 'serif'; font-size: 14pt;\">Where:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 1.0in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l2 level2 lfo2; tab-stops: list 1.0in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 'Courier New';\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><code><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua', 'serif';\">k</span></code><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif';\"> = size of each CLA module = 4<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 1.0in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l2 level2 lfo2; tab-stops: list 1.0in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 'Courier New';\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><code><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua', 'serif';\">n</span></code><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif';\"> = total number of bits = 64<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 1.0in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l2 level2 lfo2; tab-stops: list 1.0in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 'Courier New';\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><code><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua', 'serif';\">&delta;</span></code><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif';\"> = delay of a basic gate = 2 ns<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Book Antiqua', 'serif'; color: black;\">Step-by-Step Delay Calculation:<o:p></o:p></span></h4>\n<p style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Book Antiqua'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Book Antiqua';\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif';\">Calculate log</span>ₖ</strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif';\"> n:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif';\"><br />log</span>₄<span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif';\"> 64 = log</span>₂<span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif';\"> 64 / log</span>₂<span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif';\"> 4 = 6 / 2 = 3<br />So, ceil(log</span>₄<span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif';\"> 64) = 3<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Book Antiqua'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Book Antiqua';\">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif';\">Plug into the formula:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif';\"><br />T_CLA = 6 + 2 &times; 3 = 6 + 6 = 12<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Book Antiqua'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Book Antiqua';\">3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif';\">Multiply by basic gate delay:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif';\"><br />Total delay = 12 &times; 2 ns = <strong>24 ns</strong><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'Book Antiqua', 'serif';\">Step 3: Interpreting Each Term in Formula<o:p></o:p></span></h3>\n<p style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif';\">The <strong>6</strong> in the formula accounts for the internal delays of the CLA logic for generate/propagate and the final sum calculation.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: 'Book Antiqua','serif';\">The <strong>2 &times; ceil(log₄</strong><strong> 64)</strong> comes from the hierarchical combination of CLA modules. Since each higher level combines the carry outputs of lower modules, this adds more delay as the number of modules increases.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Book Antiqua', 'serif';\"> The <strong>&delta;</strong> is just the basic gate delay.<br /><img src=\"media/0a/0a4f55dce459fc4b03d4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"582\" height=\"350\" /></span></p>"
